+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Request
+Review how `applyPatch` checks and applies patches and make it conform to RFC 6902, errors included.
+
+## Outcome
+Reviewed all six operations against RFC 6902 §4 and §5 (add/remove/replace/move/copy/test, array indexes
+and `-`, move into own child, atomic failure, JSON equality). Found one deviation: an `undefined` `value`
+was accepted although it is not a JSON value (§4.1, §4.3, §4.6 require a `value`); it is now rejected.
+Test added in `test/patch.test.ts`; `npm test` passes (30).
